comps.c:
Components: which are active, with which model, how often.
Pyrenees: ice sheet and surface on the hub PYR-250M (FesmData topography);
climate (ERA5) and isostasy on PYR-2KM, the grid of the FesmData climate;
the GHF is remapped from PYR-2KM onto the Yelmo grid when loaded.

pattern.c:
snapshots: f*(snap1 - snap0), or f*snap1 without snap0 (a given anomaly / ratio);
uniform: tas + f_ta*f, pr * exp(beta_p*f_ta*f), to + f_to*f, so + f_so*f;
replace: to or so = f at every depth, in place of the reference (one per field)
